1
00:00:00,885 --> 00:00:05,225
(Sheldon:)Trust me, Kripke will fall easy prey
to my psychological warfare. Observe.

2
00:00:07,224 --> 00:00:08,934
(Leonard:)Kripke.

3
00:00:09,852 --> 00:00:12,522
(Sheldon:)I would ask if your robot
is prepared to meet its maker...

4
00:00:12,688 --> 00:00:15,728
(Sheldon:)...but as you are its maker,
clearly the two of you have met.

5
00:00:20,154 --> 00:00:22,364
What is his problem?

6
00:00:24,283 --> 00:00:26,913
(Raj:)Way to bust out
the Jedi mind tricks, dude.

7
00:00:28,537 --> 00:00:30,327
I wanna make sure that
we're all clear.

8
00:00:30,498 --> 00:00:33,418
(Leonard:)Standard Robotic
Fighting League rules apply.

9
00:00:33,584 --> 00:00:34,624
Are you crazy?

10
00:00:34,794 --> 00:00:35,964
This is a street fight.

11
00:00:36,128 --> 00:00:38,218
The street has no rules.

12
00:00:38,380 --> 00:00:40,630
(Sheldon:)He's right, Leonard.
The paradigm is to the death.

13
00:00:40,800 --> 00:00:44,840
(Kripke:)I will, however, give you the opportunity
to concede my superiority now...

14
00:00:45,012 --> 00:00:48,432
...and offer me your robot
as the spoils of war.

15
00:00:49,016 --> 00:00:51,976
(Sheldon:)Never. I'd rather see Monte dead
than in your hands.

16
00:00:52,144 --> 00:00:53,684
That could be easily arranged.

17
00:00:55,189 --> 00:00:56,399
Ready, set, go?

18
00:00:56,816 --> 00:00:59,026
(Leonard:)- Do it.
- All right, then.

